The problem statement says that some NWCSAF products in v2025 (MTG enabled) version have format changes, and satpy readers may fail.

I've looked at `satpy/readers/nwcsaf_nc.py`, `satpy/readers/nwcsaf_msg2013_hdf5.py`, and `satpy/readers/nwcsaf_hrw_nc.py`.

In `satpy/readers/nwcsaf_nc.py`, I see:
```python
